nt-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT said:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:41e8ebac-8b4b-49ec-b0ef-1601b87e79d5" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="b8991212-cf74-457a-be03-a0b4a3260205"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_m6_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="b8991212-cf74-457a-be03-a0b4a3260205" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="2" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="b8991212-cf74-457a-be03-a0b4a3260205"><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Ronit, tumhari </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">README.md</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> file ka content add ho gaya hai. 👍</span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Maine tumhara content check kiya. Sections sahi hain, lekin </span><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Tech Stack ke badges aur top banner abhi visible nahi ho rahe</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">.</span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Ab ye karo:</span></p><h2 class="TextBase-qM5iDq Title-mwq_Iy" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Step 2 – Banner upload karo</span></h2><ol class="List-GOP23i" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">GitHub repository </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">ronit810A</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> open karo.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Add file → Upload files</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> par click karo.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Apni banner image select karo.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Image ka naam rakho </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">github-banner.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-n