imple steps batata hoon.</span></p><h2 class="TextBase-qM5iDq Title-mwq_Iy" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Step 1: Banner image download karo</span></h2><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Jo Neon Cyber Developer banner design humne banaya tha, us image ko apne computer mein save karo.</span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Image ka naam rakho:</span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">github-banner.png</span></code></p><h2 class="TextBase-qM5iDq Title-mwq_Iy" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Step 2: GitHub par image upload karo</span></h2><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); height: auto; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="Image-ZGWcOW OverlayBox-NDn8wp LoadingFrame-SiXPxc group/search-image" data-d-component="image" data-d-stream-media="" data-d-hover-zoom="" style="border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;" data-d-frame=""><img alt="What Is GitH